WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Editing with an agent starts with one habit.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.800
You give it the words first.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.290
So the first step is to cut the video.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.530
Sorry, let me start that again.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.720
So the first step is to transcribe the video.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.400
Every word gets a timestamp.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:25.670
Um, then the agent cuts the mistakes and the dead air.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.920
After that, it plans the beats, builds the graphics, and checks its own work.

